==Restrictions==
Deploy from Row 1 only

==Battleground==
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ms. Sign]]s spawn as bosses after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kano & Souma (Enemy)|Kano & Souma]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The easiest level out of the three, although Kano & Souma have 80,000 health and a 100% chance to produce a level 2 [[Wave Attack]], they only have 880 damage so they won't be much of a threat. Using ranged attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] will help beat this stage.

